{
  "id": "book-rules",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Alan kuralları",
    "en": "Field rules"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "language": "python",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "entry": "main.py",
  "files": [
    {
      "name": "main.py",
      "starter": "starter-main.{lang}.py",
      "solution": "solution-main.py"
    }
  ],
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`Field(min_length=1, max_length=80)`, `Field(ge=1450, le=2100)`, `Field(gt=0)`.",
      "en": "`Field(min_length=1, max_length=80)`, `Field(ge=1450, le=2100)`, `Field(gt=0)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, Field\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n\nclass Book(BaseModel):\n    title: str = Field(min_length=1, max_length=80)\n    year: int = Field(ge=1450, le=2100)\n    pages: int = Field(gt=0)\n\n\n@app.post(\"/books\", status_code=201)\ndef add_book(book: Book):\n    return book\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, Field\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n\nclass Book(BaseModel):\n    title: str = Field(min_length=1, max_length=80)\n    year: int = Field(ge=1450, le=2100)\n    pages: int = Field(gt=0)\n\n\n@app.post(\"/books\", status_code=201)\ndef add_book(book: Book):\n    return book\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "http",
      "steps": [
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/books",
          "json": {
            "title": "Dune",
            "year": 1965,
            "pages": 412
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 201,
            "json": {
              "title": "Dune",
              "year": 1965,
              "pages": 412
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/books",
          "json": {
            "title": "",
            "year": 1965,
            "pages": 412
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 422
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/books",
          "json": {
            "title": "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
            "year": 1965,
            "pages": 412
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 422
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/books",
          "json": {
            "title": "Dune",
            "year": 2101,
            "pages": 412
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 422
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/books",
          "json": {
            "title": "Dune",
            "year": 1449,
            "pages": 412
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 422
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/books",
          "json": {
            "title": "Dune",
            "year": 1450,
            "pages": 1
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 201
          }
        },
        {
